														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1879414">
									

<blockquote>
<p>they downvoted simply because a face was put to Mr. Dark.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Someone warned me people might do that before I posted 1716, and I pretty much decided if they do, they do. I'm actually encouraging more people to write Dark tales (and I'm not done with him myself &#8212; I'm working on a Person of Interest file for him)&#8230; he's mysterious enough that there can be many conflicting takes on him, all consistent with what MC &amp; D does. I don't want to &quot;own&quot; the character (he's not mine anyway &#8212; Gears created him).</p>
<p>I would like to see more GOI-based adversary characters written up. They flesh out the Foundation universe a bit more. Also, they're fun to write. If the Foundation were a RP game, the author avatars would be the PCs, and folks like Dark the NPCs. You actually have a lot more freedom in some ways when writing NPCs.</p>

							</div>

