														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1879342">
									

<p>My opinions on the subject in bullet points:</p>
<ul>
<li>We totally need more characters.</li>
<li><em>My</em> Foundation would totally lock up the cyborg-agent. It's irrational and trigger-happy like that when it comes to normalcy.</li>
<li>That said, I would totally read other people's take on the issue. Good writing always trumps headcanons.</li>
<li>Good character don't need to be anomalous.</li>
<li>Anomalous characters don't need to work for/with the Foundation.</li>
<li>We need more RB PoV characters.</li>
<li>Blackwood should be mentioned as an established, popular, non-Foundation character.</li>
<li>I should finally go finish all my character-centered drafts. Some of them are years old. Seriously, me, get your shit together.</li>
<li>This is a good essay.</li>
</ul>

							</div>

								
					
