			<div class="content" id="post-content-1879456">
									

<p>A very interesting essay.</p>
<p>I'd like to remark the part in which the &quot;anthagonists&quot; should have some more tales around 'cause I've been having a Point Of View tale over my head for months. I somehow thought long time ago that it would be innovative to make a character from an enemy faction as the prothagonist and make the foundation the anthagonist faction. Yet I have never really got a &quot;character base&quot; to start with due to the lack of info of how many of these factions work inside, AWCY?, MC&amp;D, the Fifth Church, the Chaos Insurgency, etc. Are known all around the site, but we have no goddamn idea of how they work inside and as most of us have not made this faction, we fear to touch it from it's inside and break 'em up.</p>
<p>Well, No guts No glory. Your essay inspired me, I'm gonna start thinking for a good Prothagonist Character for a possible tale with the Chaos Insurgency as the &quot;good guys around which the plot runs.&quot;</p>

