<p>I don't see them as the bad guys either, it's just that the Foundation <em>wants</em> to make them look as the bad guys, for me they're just a bunch of ex-foundation members with a different view of uses with SCPs.</p>
<p>Yet, as you said, the conditions they &quot;Suffer&quot; make them act a bit like<br />
